| a | b |
| --- | --- |
| x | `y` z |
| `p` z `q` | r |

| a | b |
| --- | --- |
| `p` z `q` | r |
| x | `y` z |

| a | b |
| --- | --- |
| `type` | `web` (alias `redis`). **Immutable.** |

| Field | Notes |
| --- | --- |
| `routes` | SPA (e.g. fallback to `index.html`). |

```


